ion/{SYMBOLS,ERRORS,CONFIGS}.md` — Phase A artifacts\n- `translation/tests/harness/mod.rs` — dual-`.so` loader, fd capture, seeded PRNG\n- `translation/tests/{phase_b_valid,phase_c_errors,phase_d_symbols,stress_exhaustive}.rs`\n- `translation/run_all_features.sh` — derives the feature power set from `Cargo.toml` (no hard-coding) and cross-runs it against both profiles\n\nOne caveat: the sandbox has no network, so I added `offline = true` to `translation/.cargo/config.toml` to resolve `libloading` from the local cargo cache. `c_src/` is unmodified (only the gitignored `build/` directory was added by the required cmake build).","ttft_ms":2396,"type":"result","duration_ms":724635,"uuid":"c0107e85-fd6c-44ac-a82b-13113fae18bc","ttft_stream_ms":2249,"time_to_request_ms":51,"first_content_frame_ms":2249,"queued_turn_count":0}
